  "reflection": "Red/White combo, Blue tees. 80F, 10 mph NW gusting 20. Firm fairways, short rough, greens faster than Oak Brook practice green. 74 (+2), 38/36. Zero doubles. Two penalty strokes, both 3-hybrid into water (holes 3 and 18). One three-putt (hole 5, 50 ft severe uphill, first putt 7 ft short). Missed 3-ft birdie putt on 11 and 7-ft par putt on 5, both right-to-left, both pushed right playing outside the hole. Lag putting excellent otherwise, including all downhill lags. Driver fade setup held on stock swings; misses into bad lies came from changed intent (holes 5, 6, 9, 18). 60-90 yd fairway wedges: 0 quality strikes in 4 attempts. 3-hybrid 0-for-3. 64 LW used once (hole 6), converted."
